illblank-option-15' index='3' name='fbo-902938-3' data-testid='fillblank-select-902938-3'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-902938-3'></option><option value=\"application\" data-testid='fillblank-option-902938-3-application'>application</option><option value=\"game\" data-testid='fillblank-option-902938-3-game'>game</option></select></span> </strong>on their phone.</p>\n<p>Linh: Technology is amazing! Scientists always create new ways to make life more convenient.</p>\n<p>Nam: Yes! I wonder what new inventions we will see in the future.</p>",
