      "questionText": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Drag and drop to complete the text.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Technology is changing our lives in many ways. At the<strong> <span class='fillblank-option'><label>16.1</label><input id='fbo-902953-0' class='ms fillblank-option-16' index='0' name='fbo-902953-0' type='text' size='9' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-902953-0' /></span></strong>, security checks are now faster because of new machines. A <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>16.2</label><input id='fbo-902953-1' class='ms fillblank-option-16' index='1' name='fbo-902953-1' type='text' size='8' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-902953-1' /></span></strong> can quickly check luggage, and <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>16.3</label><input id='fbo-902953-2' class='ms fillblank-option-16' index='2' name='fbo-902953-2' type='text' size='15' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-902953-2' /></span></strong> systems use fingerprints or facial scans to confirm a person&#8217;s identity. This helps make travel safer and more <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>16.4</label><input id='fbo-902953-3' class='ms fillblank-option-16' index='3' name='fbo-902953-3' type='text' size='14' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-902953-3' /></span></strong>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">In daily life, technology also helps people communicate, work, and learn. A great <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>16.5</label><input id='fbo-902953-4' class='ms fillblank-option-16' index='4' name='fbo-902953-4' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-902953-4' /></span></strong> is the smartphone, which allows people to call, message, and search for information easily. Students can also use smart devices to study online and improve their skills.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Many <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><l